TITLE:: RCKeyboardState
summary:: Live state of an MPE keyboard
categories:: Libraries>reCurrent
related:: Classes/RCSong, Classes/RCMidi

DESCRIPTION::
The pieces' code::~on_dict:: machine as a class: one Event per channel (code::note::, code::velocity::, code::bend:: -1..1, code::touch::, code::control:: cc → value, code::time::). A new noteOn on a busy channel replaces the old note (warned), a noteOff for a different note still clears the channel (warned), and a channel silent longer than strong::staleTimeout:: seconds is dropped when read.

CLASSMETHODS::
METHOD:: new
argument:: song
argument:: deviceName
Installs the MIDIdefs when given (see link::#-listen::).
argument:: staleTimeout

INSTANCEMETHODS::
METHOD:: heldChans
Channel states holding a note, sorted by note.
